 r←Test_TableEdit_001(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;table;globalParms;parms
⍝ Test "Edit" in the simplest possible way.
 r←∆Inactive
 :Return

 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

⍝⍝⍝ Preconditions
 globalParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms.testMode←1
 table←⍉⊃('Obama' 'Bush' 'Clinton')(1 0 1)
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.Create table globalParms parms
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Close'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →FailsIf n.∆result≢table

 r←∆OK
